Package: EpiModelHIV
Version: 2.0.5
Date: 2020-10-08
Type: Package
Title: Network-Based Epidemic Modeling of HIV/STI Transmission
Description: EpiModelHIV provides extensions to our general EpiModel package to 
  allow for simulating HIV transmission dynamics among two populations: men who 
  have sex with men in the United States and heterosexual adults in sub-Saharan 
  Africa.
Maintainer: Samuel M. Jenness <samuel.m.jenness@emory.edu>
